      "width": 340,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "并行双线\n\n图像线：64 图 Flat/Hier\n视频线：EXP-VIDEO N=16\n非对称合并\n视频为唯一主实验"
    },

    {
      "id": "c_main",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1200,
      "y": -1140,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "# C｜Prompt 结构化\n（你的主战场）\n\n最接近、也最危险的一块\n空白在视频行为层"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1720,
      "y": -1300,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "C1｜张伟、罗亚远 2026\n智能系统学报 21(4):908-918\n\n图像侧结构化 vs 平铺\n100 主题 × FLUX-dev\n线性混合效应 + 配对统计\n结论：结构化稳全局版式与层级"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1720,
      "y": -1110,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "C2｜Liu & Chilton 2021/CHI\narXiv 2109.06977\n\n5493 生成 / 51 主体 × 51 风格\nprompt 设计指南开山\nHCI 侧先例"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1720,
      "y": -940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "C3｜Chong et al. 2025\nDesign Science 11:e2\n\nmono vs multi-criteria prompt\n多准则利可行性/新颖性\n单准则利局部审美"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1720,
      "y": -770,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "C5/C6｜SCoPE 2025 + HPT AAAI-24\n\n粗到细渐进嵌入 / 层级语义图\n长平铺 prompt 有信息损耗\nGenAI-Bench VQA +8"
    },
    {
      "id": "f_v02",
