    {
      "id": "a_main",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 900,
      "y": -1140,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "# A｜动作与运动控制\n（技术线）\n\n主流＝显式几何信号\n控几何，不控行为语义"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1420,
      "y": -1300,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "A1｜MotionAgent 2025\narXiv 2502.03207\n\n文本 → 显式运动场 → 光流\n注人 I2V；VBench 相机运动提升\n仍是几何级控制"
    },
    {
      "id": "a2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1420,
      "y": -1110,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "A2｜Mojito 2024\narXiv 2412.08948\n\n轨迹方向 + 运动强度双控\n免训练"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1420,
      "y": -940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "A3｜Separate Motion from Appearance\narXiv 2501.16714\n\n★ 学术镜像\n「画风层 vs 动作层可分开治」\n模型内部已做解耦\nprompt 侧还没人做"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1420,
      "y": -750,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "A4｜VBench CVPR 2024\n\n16 维含 Human Action\n标配基准，但维度粗\n你做到端点级更细"
    },

    {
      "id": "b_main",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 900,
      "y": -420,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "# B｜长视频 / 多镜头一致性\n（领域现状）\n\n>16s 行为连贯\n＝学界承认的开放问题"
    },
