      "y": -620,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "B1｜Long-Video Storytelling Survey\nICCVW 2025 · 32 篇\n\nSOTA 稳定 5-16s\n>16s 外观/布局/多主体行为连贯\n＝开放问题"
    },
