      "id": "b2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1420,
      "y": -440,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "B2｜Lights, Camera, Consistency\narXiv 2512.16954 · BITS Pilani\n\n★ 「动作跑偏」文献镜像\n撤锚定一致性 7.99→0.55\nScript Adherence 3.49\n< Prompt Adherence 4.47"
